10 REM XORBAND -- a rubber-band line drawn and undrawn with XOR
20 CZINIT:CZCIRCLE 512,384,200,64+31:CZMODE 3
30 FOR X=100 TO 900 STEP 4
40   CZLINE 512,100,X,600,255
50   CZLINE 512,100,X,600,255
60 NEXT
70 CZMODE 0:CZTEXT 20,CZYMAX-40,"XOR LEAVES THE CIRCLE UNHARMED",255,2
80 CZWAIT:PRINT "Done."
